          {
            "type": "callout",
            "tone": "definition",
            "title": "Young's modulus",
            "text": "Per unit strain jo stress lagaya jaye use Young's modulus kehte hain."
          },
          {
            "type": "equation",
            "latex": "\\text{i.e.}\\quad Y = \\frac{\\text{Tensile stress}}{\\text{Tensile strain}}",
            "text_alt": "i.e. Y = Tensile stress / Tensile strain"
          },
          {
            "type": "equation",
            "latex": "Y = \\frac{F/A}{\\Delta L/L_0} \\qquad (5.6)",
            "text_alt": "Y = (F/A) / (ΔL/L₀)   (5.6)"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Young's modulus ka unit wahi hai jo stress ka, yani N m⁻² ya Pa. Different (alag alag) materials ke Young's modulus Table 5.1 mein diye gaye hain."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Wire ka Young's modulus maloom karne ke kai tareeqe hain; un mein se ek Searle's method hai (5.4 dekhein)."
          },
          {
