          {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "mode": "self_check",
            "prompt": "2 m lambi aur 2 × 10⁻⁶ m² cross-section area wali steel wire 400 N se kheenchi jati hai. Y = 2 × 10¹¹ N m⁻² ho to extension nikalein. Phir 3 m lambi, 1 × 10⁻⁶ m² area wali copper wire par 500 N force lage to stress aur strain nikalein (copper ka Y Table 5.1 se 110 × 10⁹ N m⁻²).",
            "explanation": "Y = (F/A)/(ΔL/L₀) se ΔL = F L₀ / (A Y) = (400 × 2) / (2 × 10⁻⁶ × 2 × 10¹¹) = 800 / (4 × 10⁵) = 0.002 m = 2 mm. Copper: stress = F/A = 500 / (1 × 10⁻⁶) = 5 × 10⁸ N m⁻²; strain = stress / Y = 5 × 10⁸ / (1.1 × 10¹¹) ≈ 4.5 × 10⁻³ (koi unit nahi)."
